    "passes": true,
    "notes": "internal/controlplane/httpapi/api_keys_list_policy_test.go drives the real NewHandler + real policy.NewEngine() through every built-in role (owner/admin allow via ReasonAllowedByRole; developer/viewer/ci/support deny via ReasonDeniedNoCapability — keys.read is CapAdmin), through revoked/expired credentials (Disabled principal -> ReasonDeniedPrincipalDisabled), through a wrong-organization principal (ReasonDeniedCrossTenant; the load-bearing assertion: support is NOT a cross-tenant exception for keys.read because CapAdmin is excluded from the engine's cross-tenant clause; bonus: support cannot list keys of its own home org either — ReasonDeniedNoCapability), and through scoped grant containment (project/env/service-scoped admin grants all denied keys.read on the org root via ReasonDeniedOutOfScope, sibling project / production env / parent env-write all denied at the engine, organization-level admin grant allowed via ReasonAllowedByGrant, organization-level viewer grant denied — pinning CapAdmin against the grant path; cross-tenant {org_id} on a scoped key still 403 ReasonDeniedCrossTenant). All deny paths assert the reader is never reached and the body never echoes the seeded key id/prefix or the principal/org/member id."
  },
