+  - Secret decryption/open failures should not use generic internal errors; use `apierr.SecretDecryption` so agents can distinguish undecryptable secret material from unrelated server bugs while still receiving only a generic redacted public envelope.
+  - When a new typed error can wrap secret-bearing causes, update package-specific static redaction analyzers so the new constructor is treated as an error surface.
