+  - Routed variables resolver secret-open/provider-mismatch failures through `apierr.SecretDecryption` instead of generic `apierr.Internal`.
+  - Updated redaction static guard coverage and local AGENTS.md guidance for secret-open failures.
+- Files changed
+  - `internal/errors/errors.go`, `internal/errors/errors_test.go`
